                                "sense_id": "22acfb02-4792-348c-85e8-ed6d5794f11d",
                                "text": "This blow should be given fore-handed, as soon as the colt has quitted the wall."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "28148301-121c-4637-b729-4ef01dbc0f3e",
                                "sense_id": "22acfb02-4792-348c-85e8-ed6d5794f11d",
                                "text": "It should be delivered back-handed from the right and fore-handed from the left court."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "146b6360-0876-4125-af25-7bb09a1c046d",
                                "sense_id": "22acfb02-4792-348c-85e8-ed6d5794f11d",
                                "text": "I'll tell you, madam, to have your hunting-sword both right sharp and double-edged, that you may strike either fore-handed or back-handed, as you see reason, for a hurt with a buck's horn is a perilous"
                            }
                        ]
                    }
